#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:117
msgid "One spark still glows: the Ember Crown, sealed in Emberfall, the Master's burnt-out observatory on the border between the Fire and Shadow kingdoms. Three old braziers hold the seal shut."
msgstr ""

